{"nodes": [{"id": "apps_bff_rapor_dalga4_read_models", "label": "BFF okuma modeli katman\u0131 (read-models.ts)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "apps/bff/RAPOR-dalga4.md", "source_location": "apps/bff/src/read-models.ts", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "\u0130ki d\u00fcr\u00fcst olmayan yol vard\u0131: ekran ba\u015f\u0131na uydurma de\u011fer d\u00f6nd\u00fcrmek, ya da donmu\u015f contracts/ports'a tip eklemek. Se\u00e7ilen yol BFF'in KEND\u0130 okuma modeli katman\u0131 \u2014 mevcut kontrat tiplerini kullan\u0131r, yeni kelime da\u011farc\u0131\u011f\u0131 icat edilmez, yaln\u0131z Studio'nun ihtiya\u00e7 duydu\u011fu B\u0130RLE\u015eT\u0130RMELER eklenir. Sabit de\u011fer d\u00f6nd\u00fcren u\u00e7 testte d\u00fc\u015fer."}, {"id": "apps_bff_rapor_dalga4_maestroplatform", "label": "MaestroPlatform (MCP + Studio ortak y\u00fczeyi)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "apps/bff/RAPOR-dalga4.md", "source_location": "apps/bff/src/platform/", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "buildServer sonucuna app.platform olarak dekore edilir, yani MCP ve Studio AYNI okuma modellerini AYNI RBAC \u00fczerinden okur. Yap\u0131sal garanti: hi\u00e7bir yar\u0131da kap\u0131 kapatan, verdict yazan veya PR merge eden metot yok \u2014 test bunu isim listesiyle pinliyor. Roller her \u00e7a\u011fr\u0131da dizinden okunur; i\u015ften \u00e7\u0131kar\u0131lm\u0131\u015f bir hesab\u0131n MCP oturumu eri\u015fimini s\u00fcrd\u00fcremez."}, {"id": "apps_bff_rapor_dalga4_cursor_ayristirma_hatasi", "label": "decodeCursor parmak izi ayr\u0131\u015ft\u0131rma hatas\u0131", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "apps/bff/RAPOR-dalga4.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "\u0130lk yaz\u0131mda decodeCursor son iki nokta \u00fcst \u00fcste i\u015faretinden b\u00f6l\u00fcyordu; parmak izleri iki nokta i\u00e7eriyor (journal:<runId>:<actor>), dolay\u0131s\u0131yla ofset parmak izinin ortas\u0131ndan ayr\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131l\u0131yor, her cursor yabanc\u0131 g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcyor ve 'sonraki sayfa' sessizce HEP B\u0130R\u0130NC\u0130 SAYFAYI d\u00f6nd\u00fcr\u00fcyordu. Sayfal\u0131 listenin en zor fark edilen ar\u0131zas\u0131."}, {"id": "apps_bff_rapor_dalga4_veri_sinifi_suzgeci", "label": "Veri s\u0131n\u0131f\u0131 s\u00fczgeci (etiketsiz = gizli)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "apps/bff/RAPOR-dalga4.md", "source_location": "apps/bff/src/knowledge-policy.ts", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "UNLABELLED_CLASS = 'gizli'; undefined/null/tan\u0131nmayan s\u0131n\u0131f hepsi gizli say\u0131l\u0131r. REST'te SAYILARAK saklan\u0131r (withheld), MCP kanal\u0131nda D\u00dc\u015e\u00dcR\u00dcL\u00dcR \u2014 maskelenmez, \u00e7\u00fcnk\u00fc maskelenmi\u015f bir par\u00e7a belgenin varl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 s\u0131zd\u0131r\u0131r."}, {"id": "apps_bff_rapor_dalga4_waitingdays_hesaplanir", "label": "waitingDays saklanmaz, hesaplan\u0131r", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "apps/bff/RAPOR-dalga4.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A\u00e7\u0131l\u0131\u015fta yaz\u0131lan bir s\u00fcre okundu\u011funda zaten yanl\u0131\u015ft\u0131r. Zincir do\u011frulamas\u0131 da GET'tir: onarmaz, sadece kan\u0131tlar; bo\u015f zincir ok:false d\u00f6ner (M33 \u2014 bo\u015fluk hi\u00e7bir \u015fey kan\u0131tlamaz)."}], "edges": [{"source": "apps_bff_rapor_dalga4_read_models", "target": "apps_bff_rapor_bff_paketi", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "apps/bff/RAPOR-dalga4.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "apps_bff_rapor_dalga4_read_models", "target": "readme_katman_kurali_m44", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRA